Subject: [PATCH] Add the dragon dagger and dragon warhammer special attacks

Dragon dagger (and its poisoned variants): Puncture, two stabs with +15%
accuracy and +15% max hit for 25% energy.
Dragon warhammer: Smash, +50% max hit and a 30% Defence drain on a hit for 50%
energy.
